                <note rend="inline" type="source">815.00/4683: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Minister in
                        Honduras</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Keena</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1936-04-03T17:00:00-05:00">April 3, 1936—5 p.m.</date></dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>16. Your 34, April 1, noon, last paragraph. Yes. In your reply you will of course
                    make no reference to the “Conservative Party.”<anchor n="6" xml:id="d558-f1"
                    /></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
